/Alt (Process flow from limestone and other raw supplies through preparation and blending\054 preheating and precalcination\054 clinker formation\054 cooling\054 and grinding with additions to make cement\056 Carbonate carbon leaves as CO2 during thermal processing\073 fuel and electricity enter the system\056 These necessary manufacturing functions form the conventional comparison\056 This is a functional archetype\054 not a quantified plant or an assertion that alternative feed leaves equipment and duties unchanged\056)
>>
endobj
