/Alt (Proposed basalt recovery connects to retained cement manufacture through a still\055unselected raw preparation or controlled\055blending entry\056 Dissolution produces undissolved rock\073 separation\054 isolation and conditioning must yield acceptable calcium material\056 Other solids\054 liquids and purge need outlets\056 A dashed return indicates conditional restoration of suitable acid capacity by reuse or regeneration\054 not a demonstrated closed loop\056 Dispatch and receiving checks\054 makeup\054 wash water\054 power and heat remain necessary\056 Chemistry\054 base routing\054 host acceptance and qualified operation remain unresolved\056)
>>
endobj
