/Alt (Conditional carbon balance per tonne equivalent cement\072 reported avoided carbonate CO2 release of 456 kilograms is offset by 335\0561 kilograms CO2\055equivalent of added burdens\054 leaving a reported net reduction of 120\0569 kilograms CO2\055equivalent\056 Added burdens are recovery electricity\054 heat\054 paired reagent makeup\054 other recovery\054 remaining feed carbonates and a fixed increment\056 Labels and their values are printed in the figure and caption\056 The selected recovery and matched electricity assumptions must hold together\073 this is a calculation\054 not measured plant performance\054 and the source rounding is not reconciled here\056)
>>
