/Alt (Horizontal bars compare five reported coupled process packages at the same selected replacement and matched electricity\056 Reductions are 16\0560 percent for the selective target\054 8\0568 for moderate integration\054 and 8\0569 for the recovery\057selectivity penalty\056 Combined process penalties increase emissions by 1\0564 percent and the hot\055dilute package increases them by 40\0565 percent\056 Reductions extend right of zero and increases left\073 values and directions are also written\054 so color is not needed\056 Table 1 defines the conditions\056 These are selected calculations\054 not probabilities or proven operating conditions\056)
>>
endobj
